Package: trainingmodels
Title: Mathematical Models of Training Load and Training Response
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Jorge del Rosario", "Fernández Santos", , "jorgedelrosario.fernandez@uca.es", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5047-2976"))
Description: Implements mathematical models used in sport science to
    describe training load and its relationship with training response,
    including descriptors of daily training load and impulse-response
    models.
